    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tires easily; no fever</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild dry morning cough; no breathlessness or chest pain</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No pain at the implant sites</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No palpitations or leg swelling</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

